Package: oobiew
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: BINARY DISSECT
 Interactive binary and ELF executable dissector showing headers, symbols, and code.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
